ign.Improve","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-23T09:57:55Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844751498217945","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:03:44Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4861080-1842846814444484","game_id":"steam-4861080","kind":"announcement","title":"Dice Breakers is Coming on November 2nd!","summary":"Dice Breakers is Coming on November 2nd! I’m happy to finally announce that Dice Breakers will officially launch on November 2nd, 2026! 🎉Since releasing the demo, I’ve been working on improving the game based on the feedback from everyone who has played it.I’ve spent this time fixing bugs, improving performance, polishing different parts of the game, and adding quality-of-life improvements to make the experience smoother and more enjoyable. An Updated Demo for Steam Next Fest I’m also preparing ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-03T19:42:27Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842846814444484","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:03:44Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4861080-1840944183782638","game_id":"steam-4861080","kind":"update","title":"Demo Patch #3 – Localization Fixes","summary":"Demo Patch #3 - Localization FixesThis update fixes several font-related issues affecting the Chinese and Russian languages.# ChangesFixed missing or incorrectly displayed characters.Improved font compatibility for Chinese and Russian text.Various minor localization fixes and improvements.Thank you for playing Dice Breakers Demo!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-15T18:05:37Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840944183782638","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:03:44Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4861080-1836506165570892","game_id":"steam-4861080","kind":"update","title":"Demo Patch #2 - Bug Fixes & Improvements","summary":"Demo Patch #2Thanks to everyone who has played the demo and shared feedback! This update focuses on fixing minor bugs and improving the overall experience.# ChangesIncreased the demo level cap from 9 to 10.Reduced the cost of the first Prestige from 42,000 to 35,000.# FixesFixed a bug in the Talent Tree that allowed players to access talents that are locked in the demo (they had no effect).Fixed several issues with the tutorial text.Fixed an issue with the demo's maximum level cap.I also created","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-03T15:46:39Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1836506165570892","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:03:44Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4861080-1836506165565442","game_id":"steam-4861080","kind":"update","title":"Demo Patch #1 - Bug Fixes & Improvements","summary":"Demo Patch #1Thanks to everyone who has played the demo and shared feedback! This update focuses on fixing bugs and improving the overall experience.These issues were introduced during the process of preparing the demo build and were not present in the main development version.# FixesFixed a bug where coins would not disappear after performing a Prestige.Fixed a bug where some upgrades would incorrectly persist after a Prestige.Fixed an issue with the Prestige Tree icons.Fixed a bug that could c","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-01T13:42:07Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1836506165565442","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:03:44Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4861080-1836506165563515","game_id":"steam-4861080","kind":"announcement","title":"Dice Breakers Demo is out now!","summary":"After months of development, I'm excited to finally share the first playable version of Dice Breakers!Dice Breakers is a satisfying incremental clicker where you'll smash dice, earn rewards, unlock powerful upgrades, automate your production, and build the ultimate dice-breaking empire.The demo includes:🎲 The core gameplay loop⚙️ Multiple upgrades and automation mechanics📈 A taste of the progression system💥 Plenty of dice to break!I'd love to hear what you think! If you have any feedback, ideas,","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-30T20:11:00Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1836506165563515","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:03:44Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4861080-1835871199306788","game_id":"steam-4861080","kind":"announcement","title":"Dice Breakers Steam Page Is Now Live!","summary":"🎉 Big News! 🎉The Steam page for Dice Breakers is now officially live! You can check it out and wishlist the game here: Every wishlist helps me tremendously and brings the game one step closer to launch. If you like what you see, don't forget to add Dice Breakers to your wishlist and share it with your friends!Thank you all for your support and for being part of this journey. More updates and exciting news are coming soon! ❤️","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-19T11:28:45Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1835871199306788","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:03:44Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4861080":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T14:52:17Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T14:52:16Z","error_codes":[]}},"news